  ["How is this different from the Women’s Wellness IOP?", "The Women’s Trauma IOP is focused specifically on healing from trauma. Our broader <a class='inl' href='/programs/womens-wellness-iop/'>Women’s Wellness IOP</a> supports burnout, anxiety, stress, life transitions, and self-esteem. Not sure which fits? We’ll help you decide."],
