---

<Base title="Women's Trauma IOP in CT | Hopewell Health Solutions" description="A Women's Trauma Intensive Outpatient Program at Hopewell Health Solutions, Glastonbury CT — trauma-focused, evening (Mon–Thu 5–8 PM), 8 weeks. Heal in a supportive community of women. Most insurance accepted." image={P + "iop-group-room-lights.webp"}>
  <Header />
  <main class="hw">
    <ServiceHero
      crumbs={[{ label: "Programs", href: "/programs/" }, { label: "IOP", href: "/programs/intensive-outpatient-program/" }, { label: "Women's Trauma" }]}
      title="Women's Trauma Intensive Outpatient Program (IOP)"
      lede="Women's Trauma IOP · Glastonbury, CT · Evenings. Rebuild your life, one step at a time."
      bullets={heroUsps}
      facts={[{ icon: "star", text: "4.8 · 368 Google reviews" }, { icon: "clock", text: "Mon–Thu · 5–8 PM" }]}
      image={P + "iop-group-room-lights.webp"}
    >
      <p style="margin-top:18px;font-size:14.5px;color:#b9cbe0">Medically reviewed by <a class="inl" href="/provider/kristine-a-schlichting-ph-d/">Kristine Schlichting, PhD</a></p>
    </ServiceHero>
    <Creds />

    <section class="section is-white">
      <div class="container pg-two">
        <div>
          <h2>A supportive space to heal from trauma</h2>
          <p class="lede"><strong>Welcome.</strong> Our Women’s Trauma IOP — Monday through Thursday, 5:00–8:00 PM — helps women balance life’s responsibilities with their healing journey. It’s a meaningful act of self-care: an opportunity to invest in your well-being while managing daily commitments.</p>
          <p class="lede">Over this 8-week program (extendable based on your needs and progress), you’ll be part of a supportive community focused on recovery from trauma — a proactive approach that mediates symptoms effectively and helps prevent the need for hospitalization or a higher level of care.</p>
        </div>
        <Schedule title="Women’s Trauma IOP week" stat="3 h" note="every evening · Monday–Thursday · 5:00–8:00 PM" days={[3, 3, 3, 3, 0, 0, 0]} tone={3} icon="heart" tracks={[["Evening group", "5:00–8:00 PM at 300 Hebron Ave, Glastonbury"], ["About 8 weeks", "Extendable based on your needs and progress"]]} />
      </div>
    </section>

    <Split heading="What is trauma?" img={P + "group-room-bright.webp"} alt="A calm Hopewell group room for trauma recovery" img2="/Assets/girl%20thinking%20worried.webp" alt2="Understanding trauma and its lasting effects" reverse tone="stone">
      <p><strong>Understanding it is the first step.</strong> Trauma can come from a single event, or a series of events or circumstances that feel emotionally or physically harmful or life-threatening — with lasting effects on your functioning and your physical, social, emotional, or spiritual well-being.</p>
      <p>Trauma is deeply personal. Different people react to similar events in very different ways — what one person finds traumatic, another may not. There’s no “right” way to respond, and there’s no shame in needing support. Learn more about <a class="inl" href="/what-we-treat/trauma-ptsd/">trauma &amp; PTSD treatment</a>.</p>
    </Split>

    <IconCards heading="Symptoms of trauma to look for" lede="Know the signs. The impact of trauma can be profound and long-lasting, and it shows up differently for everyone — commonly across five areas:" items={symptoms} cols={3} />

    <IconCards heading="What our program offers" lede="Comprehensive, tailored care. We believe in the power of community and collaborative healing — with step-down support as you transition to less intensive care." items={offer} cols={3} tone="mist" />

    <Quote text="You gain the collective strength of women who understand — and the reassurance that you are not alone on this journey." cite="The value of community in healing" img={P + "iop-group-room-lights.webp"} />

    <IconCards heading="The right care, at the right time" lede="Why now." items={why} cols={2}>
      <p class="sec-foot">Looking for broader support beyond trauma? Explore our <a class="inl" href="/programs/womens-wellness-iop/">Women’s Wellness IOP</a>.</p>
    </IconCards>

    <VideoCarousel videos={stories} heading="Women’s Stories, in Their Own Words" lede="Women who have been through our IOPs share what changed. More conversations on the <a class='inl' href='/podcast/'>Hope, Health &amp; Healing podcast</a>." />

    <NewsVideos heading="Trauma in women" lede="As seen on NBC Connecticut. Connecticut’s news outlets turn to our clinicians to talk about women’s mental health and trauma. Watch our team on CT Live! discuss why so many women carry trauma — and how the right support changes everything." videos={[{ id: "uDy-K1dO0Fw", t: "CT Live!: Trauma in Women — Hopewell Health Solutions", outlet: "NBC Connecticut" }]} />

    <MediaStrip bg="white" heading="Our clinicians, featured across Connecticut" />
    <Reviews heading="What Our IOP Clients Say" tone="stone" first={["Women’s Wellness IOP", "IOP"]} />
    <Team heading="Trauma-Informed Clinicians" lede="EMDR, DBT and somatic care from a woman-led team. <a class='inl' href='/about-us/team/'>Meet our full team</a>." slugs={["teesha-huertas-lcsw", "christina-lindsay-pmhnp-bc-aprn", "chelsey-micciche-lpc", "kaitlyn-czapiga-lmsw", "traci-schneider-maatc-lpc-a-atr-p", "dori-bessette-crail-lmft", "erica-schwartz-lcat"]} tone="white" />

    <Insurance heading="Covered by most major plans" lede="The Women’s Trauma IOP is covered by most major commercial insurance plans. Our team verifies your benefits at no cost — before you commit to anything." />
    <Locations heading="Our Locations" lede="The Women’s Trauma IOP is held at 300 Hebron Ave, Glastonbury · plus virtual visits statewide. Reach us at <a class='inl' href='tel:8607351448'>(860) 735-1448</a> · <a class='inl' href='mailto:hhs4help@gmail.com'>hhs4help@gmail.com</a>." current="glastonbury-ct-2" />
    <Faq faqs={faqs} heading="Women’s Trauma IOP — common questions" tone="white" />
    <OtherPrograms current="/programs/womens-trauma-iop/" />
    <ClosingCta heading="We’re here for you" lede="If you’re ready to begin your journey to recovery — or just have questions — reach out. We’ll help you rebuild your life, one step at a time, in a supportive and caring environment." image={P + "group-room-bright.webp"} />
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
